"The '%(formula)s' formula needs variables with codes: %(codes)s. Missing: "
"%(missing)s."
msgstr ""
"تحتاج الصيغة '%(formula)s' إلى متغيّرات بالرموز: %(codes)s. المفقود: "
"%(missing)s."

#. module: era_monte_carlo_simulation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:era_monte_carlo_simulation.field_monte_carlo_model__ai_summary
msgid ""
"The AI-generated summary of this model's most recent completed run, shown "
"here for quick reference. Open a run and click 'Explain with AI' to generate"
